  "interpretation": [
    "the preregistered pooled GAM supports the predicted negative relationship between pre-outcome predictive connectivity and arrival-greenup mismatch",
    "the sign is stable to 8-year versus 10-year windows, Gaussian binary mapping, all leave-one-species-out fits and all leave-one-year-out fits",
    "the effect disappears when raw undetrended correlation is used, supporting the distinction between interannual predictive information and a shared long-term climate trend",
    "cluster-robust and species-level uncertainty intervals cross zero, so the result is not licensed as species-independent confirmation",
    "the natural-data evidence is therefore a pooled directional signal with dependence-sensitive uncertainty"
  ],
  "claim_boundary": [
    "37 of the original 55 species enter the 8-year pre-outcome analysis because sufficient trailing history is required",
    "the 3311 rows are not independent biological replicates",
    "grid frequencies and p-values must not be converted into a claim that predictive connectivity universally controls migration",
    "this analysis tests realized mismatch, not community-level hysteresis",
    "the frozen universal speed-ratio falsification remains unchanged"
  ]
